id payment-message-check
title Check a payment message, field by field
lang eve
audience banks, central banks, payment operators, fintechs
safety none
summary Every field of a payment message is checked against exact Eve types: no rounding, no unknown currencies, and the Ada spec must declare the same layout.
inputs inputs.txt
step check eve payment.eve type=payment same=payment.ads
draft payment.eve Write Eve types for the payment record the user describes; use exact decimal types and ranges.
